---
// src/components/Header.astro - サイト共通ヘッダー（言語切替含む）
import { t, getAlternateUrl } from '../i18n';
import type { Locale } from '../config';

interface Props {
  lang: Locale;
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
const dict = t(lang);
const homeBase = lang === 'ja' ? '/' : '/en/';
const alternateUrl = getAlternateUrl(Astro.url, lang);
---

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a href={homeBase} class="site-logo" aria-label="Mindseed Research">
      <svg class="logo-mark" viewBox="0 0 32 32" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="16" cy="19" r="9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/>
        <path d="M 16 9 Q 16 4 20 3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="logo-text">Mindseed Research</span>
    </a>
    <nav aria-label={dict.nav.home}>
      <ul class="nav-list">
        <li><a href={`${homeBase}about/`}>{dict.nav.about}</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${homeBase}concept/`}>{dict.nav.concept}</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${homeBase}essays/`}>{dict.nav.essays}</a></li>
        <li><a href={`${homeBase}contact/`}>{dict.nav.contact}</a></li>
        <li class="lang-switch"><a href={alternateUrl} hreflang={lang === 'ja' ? 'en' : 'ja'}>{dict.nav.languageSwitch}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .site-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }
  .header-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width-wide);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .site-logo {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }
  .logo-mark {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .nav-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .nav-list a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .nav-list a:hover {
    color: var(--color-link);
  }
  .lang-switch a {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 0.15em 0.6em;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .header-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .nav-list { gap: var(--space-sm); }
  }
</style>
